Comparison of the image decoders with Pillow:

  python3 imgt_gen.py            # writes samples and Pillow digests to /tmp/imgt
  IMGT_DIR=/tmp/imgt go test ./internal/images -run PillowCompare
  python3 imgt_cmp.py            # lists the files decoded differently

Expected differences (Pillow bugs): a.cur (mask ignored), a.xbm (inverted),
a.xpm (Pillow fails), bc6hs.dds (negative values), lab.psd (no Lab
conversion), rgb16.tga (5-bit expansion, alpha bit), a.pcd (rounding).
JPEG 2000 (irrl.jp2, big.jp2): a few pixels off by one (9/7 float rounding).
